#: ../../source/reference/liteframe/generated/maxframe.liteframe.LiteFrame.str.pad.rst:2
msgid "maxframe.liteframe.LiteFrame.str.pad"
msgstr ""

#: of pandas.core.strings.accessor.StringMethods.pad:1
msgid "Pad strings in the Series/Index up to width."
msgstr "将 Series/Index 中的字符串填充到指定宽度。"

#: of pandas.core.strings.accessor.StringMethods.pad:3
msgid ""
"This function pads strings in a Series or Index to a specified width, "
"filling the extra space with a character of your choice. It provides "
"flexibility in positioning the padding, allowing it to be added to the "
"left, right, or both sides. This is useful for formatting strings to "
"align text or ensure consistent string lengths in data processing."
msgstr "此函数将 Series 或 Index 中的字符串填充到指定宽度，用您选择的字符填充多余空间。它在定位填充方面提供了灵活性，允许将其添加到左侧、右侧或两侧。这对于格式化字符串以对齐文本或确保数据处理中字符串长度一致很有用。"

#: ../../source/reference/liteframe/generated/maxframe.liteframe.LiteFrame.str.pad.rst
msgid "参数"
msgstr ""

#: of pandas.core.strings.accessor.StringMethods.pad:9
msgid ""
"Minimum width of resulting string; additional characters will be filled "
"with character defined in `fillchar`."
msgstr "结果字符串的最小宽度；附加字符将用 `fillchar` 中定义的字符填充。"

#: of pandas.core.strings.accessor.StringMethods.pad:12
msgid "Side from which to fill resulting string."
msgstr "从哪一侧填充结果字符串。"

#: of pandas.core.strings.accessor.StringMethods.pad:14
msgid "Additional character for filling, default is whitespace."
msgstr "用于填充的附加字符，默认为空格。"

#: ../../source/reference/liteframe/generated/maxframe.liteframe.LiteFrame.str.pad.rst
msgid "返回"
msgstr ""

#: of pandas.core.strings.accessor.StringMethods.pad:17
msgid "Returns Series or Index with minimum number of char in object."
msgstr "返回对象中具有最少字符数的 Series 或 Index。"

#: ../../source/reference/liteframe/generated/maxframe.liteframe.LiteFrame.str.pad.rst
msgid "返回类型"
msgstr ""

#: of pandas.core.strings.accessor.StringMethods.pad:22
msgid ":py:obj:`LiteFrame.str.rjust`"
msgstr ""

#: of pandas.core.strings.accessor.StringMethods.pad:23
msgid ""
"Fills the left side of strings with an arbitrary character. Equivalent to"
" ``LiteFrame.str.pad(side='left')``."
msgstr "用任意字符填充字符串的左侧。等价于 ``LiteFrame.str.pad(side='left')``。"

#: of pandas.core.strings.accessor.StringMethods.pad:25
msgid ":py:obj:`LiteFrame.str.ljust`"
msgstr ""

#: of pandas.core.strings.accessor.StringMethods.pad:26
msgid ""
"Fills the right side of strings with an arbitrary character. Equivalent "
"to ``LiteFrame.str.pad(side='right')``."
msgstr "用任意字符填充字符串的右侧。等价于 ``LiteFrame.str.pad(side='right')``。"

#: of pandas.core.strings.accessor.StringMethods.pad:28
msgid ":py:obj:`LiteFrame.str.center`"
msgstr ""

#: of pandas.core.strings.accessor.StringMethods.pad:29
msgid ""
"Fills both sides of strings with an arbitrary character. Equivalent to "
"``LiteFrame.str.pad(side='both')``."
msgstr "用任意字符填充字符串的两侧。等价于 ``LiteFrame.str.pad(side='both')``。"

#: of pandas.core.strings.accessor.StringMethods.pad:31
msgid ":py:obj:`LiteFrame.str.zfill`"
msgstr ""

#: of pandas.core.strings.accessor.StringMethods.pad:32
msgid ""
"Pad strings in the Series/Index by prepending '0' character. Equivalent "
"to ``LiteFrame.str.pad(side='left', fillchar='0')``."
msgstr ""
"通过在 Series/Index 中的字符串前面添加 '0' 字符来填充。等价于 ``LiteFrame"
".str.pad(side='left', fillchar='0')``。"
